    "category": "Binary Search",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an array nums representing money in houses and an integer k, rob at least k non-adjacent houses. The capability of a robbery plan is the maximum money stolen from any robbed house. Return the minimum possible capability.",
